"\u2018The still place\u2019 is an established private log label in locked Books 5\u20136, not a new phrase in Movement 8. Movement 7 must not spend the new beat: keep Cael\u2019s finding private, unnamed aloud, and owed to Oryn. In Movement 8, the beat is that the old log label becomes a repeatedly read LOCATION and a shared spoken finding: after the second and third self-readings, Cael attaches \u2018the still place\u2019 to the located anomaly, tells Oryn while reading her with permission, and she answers the finding. Do not present the words as newly coined or new to the reader; preserve \u2018Not the Quiet. Not a fragment.\u2019 and all withheld-source limits."